# sh-to-py C3a1: design plan-review loop core
Part of the sh-to-py bash-to-Python migration (umbrella tracking issue links all parts).
**Goal**: Port the /design plan-review loop: panel dispatch, voter dispatch, plan-review tally, round snapshots/timing, step-3 state, gate-B dedup, plan emission/finalization.
**Notes**: calls C3a2 validation/revision functions in-process. Harnesses test-plan-review-loop.sh (1834), test-dispatch-plan-review-panel.sh, test-run-step3-review.sh, test-design-structure.sh (relevant slices) port to pytest here.
**Dependencies (wired natively via /block-issue)**: C3a2, B5.
**Definition of done**: importable functions; CLI verbs in python/cli.py; direct call-site cutover (no shims); pytest replaces harness coverage; absorbed bash + harnesses deleted; stale-reference sweep; make lint + py-lint + py-test green.
